/E (We speak by phone every morning. this morning she told me that she had a conversation with a couple at the next table, and that the husband was very "into crypto." He told her eth was his favorite coin. My wife, who is far more blunt and directly confrontational than me, blurted out "Isn't that a shitcoin?" Of course the guy was offended and he tried to convince her of its value. She asked him if he had ever read Jeff Booth's book. He had no idea who he was.  She then decided to talk to his wife instead.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [26]
>>
